---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Vanish — Auto Pointer Hider"
  description="Privacy Policy for the Vanish Chrome Extension."
  noindex={true}
>
  <div class="privacy-page">
    <div class="container container-readable">
      <div class="page-header">
        <h1 class="page-title">Privacy Policy for Vanish &mdash; Auto Pointer Hider</h1>
        <p class="page-subtitle"><strong>Effective Date:</strong> July 26, 2026</p>
      </div>

      <section class="prose">
        <p>
          Vanish ("the Extension") is built with privacy as a core principle. This Privacy Policy explains how data is handled by the Extension.
        </p>

        <h3 class="subsection-title">1. Zero Data Collection</h3>
        <p>
          Vanish does <strong>NOT</strong> collect, store, log, transmit, or sell any personal data, browsing history, user credentials, or IP addresses to any external servers or third parties.
        </p>

        <h3 class="subsection-title">2. Local Storage Only</h3>
        <p>
          All extension preferences (such as your chosen idle delay timer, theme, and custom domain list) are stored locally inside your browser using <code>chrome.storage.sync</code>. This data remains entirely on your device and inside your synced Google Account settings. It is never transmitted to or accessible by the developer.
        </p>

        <h3 class="subsection-title">3. Analytics & Trackers</h3>
        <p>
          Vanish contains <strong>NO</strong> third-party analytics, tracking pixels, advertising frameworks, or remote code scripts.
        </p>

        <h3 class="subsection-title">4. Contact Information</h3>
        <p>
          If you have any questions regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Developer:</strong> Mateus Tavares</li>
          <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:me@mattavares.com">me@mattavares.com</a></li>
          <li><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://mattavares.com/contact/">https://mattavares.com/contact/</a></li>
        </ul>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .privacy-page {
    padding: 3.5rem 0 5rem 0;
  }

  .container-readable {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .page-header {
    text-align: left;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .page-title {
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .page-subtitle {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-size: 1.125rem;
  }

  .prose {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .prose p {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .prose ul {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }

  .prose li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .prose a {
    color: var(--brand-sage);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .prose a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .subsection-title {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--brand-sage);
  }
</style>
